  "id": "2019/01/08/webpack-v3-v4-globalobject-window",
  "href": "/fe/2019/01/08/webpack-v3-v4-globalobject-window",
  "title": "Webpack从v3升级到v4后默认globalObject会变成window",
  "date": "2019-01-07T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Webpack从v3升级到v4后默认globalObject会变成window\n\n今天小伙伴出于安全考虑把Webpack从v3升级到v4（太可怕了直接一个大版本更新），结果导致我们node上面引用的umd包竟然就挂了，报错内容是 window is undefined.\n\n搜了下Stack Overflow，果然很多人也有这样的问题。从v4开始，webpack默认globalObject为window。\n\n如上改动即可",
  "category": {
    "label": "fe",
    "href": "/fe"
  },
